### Configuracion activa
GET http://localhost:8080/api/envios/config

### Normal: 4 kg, compra 100  ->  18.00
POST http://localhost:8080/api/envios/cotizar
Content-Type: application/json

{ "pesoKg": 4, "montoCompra": 100, "express": false }

### Express: 4 kg, compra 100  ->  23.40
POST http://localhost:8080/api/envios/cotizar
Content-Type: application/json

{ "pesoKg": 4, "montoCompra": 100, "express": true }

### Envio gratis: 4 kg, compra 150  ->  0.00
POST http://localhost:8080/api/envios/cotizar
Content-Type: application/json

{ "pesoKg": 4, "montoCompra": 150, "express": false }

### Peso mayor al maximo  ->  400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/envios/cotizar
Content-Type: application/json

{ "pesoKg": 31, "montoCompra": 50, "express": false }
